<title>FRANCE: EU agrees Italian rice aid for Jordan - sources.</title>
<headline>EU agrees Italian rice aid for Jordan - sources.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union agreed the supply of Italian medium-grain rice worth five billion lire to Jordan as food aid, grain industry sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>The EU took the decision at a weekly meeting of its grain panel on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
